        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Heat, natural gas, at boiler modulating &lt;100kW
na;
UUID: 02ec2028-60e9-3f4f-a2af-a7f04d63e2a1
The module calls the module "natural gas, burned in boiler modulating &lt;100kW" which in turn includes fuel input from low pressure (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions, and electricity needed for operation. The module uses the average net efficiency for the type of boiler (estimated from literature). The heat distribution is not included.; Geography: Extrapolation from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Location:  Extrapolation from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Technology: New models on market
